      },
      "tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2094730752327860303",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-01T10:15:04.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/EdwardJDavey/status/2094730752327860303",
          "textSnippet": "I've written to the Prime Minister ahead of his first statement later today, with a clear message:\n\nOur politics is broken and we can’t fix our country until we fix our politics."
        },
        {
          "id": "2094730754450239733",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-01T10:15:04.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/EdwardJDavey/status/2094730754450239733",
          "textSnippet": "Over the past decade how many “ten year plans” have we had? We’ve had PM after PM.\n\nSome even had good intentions, but all of them were trapped in a system that rewards failure, and stops them from taking the tough decisions to actually change things for the better."
        },
        {
          "id": "2094730755855290588",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-01T10:15:05.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/EdwardJDavey/status/2094730755855290588",
          "textSnippet": "We will do everything in our power - including supporting rebel Labour MPs – to make the PM remember what he said just a few years ago: “I don’t see how anyone could call this a properly functioning democratic system. It’s actually a national embarrassment.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "2094730757352644784",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-01T10:15:05.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/EdwardJDavey/status/2094730757352644784",
          "textSnippet": "We need to get corruption out of our system. We need to get big money out too. We desperately need electoral reform to get rid of a voting system that often protects the very politicians who broke our system in the first place."
        },
        {
          "id": "2094730758883570171",
          "type": "original",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-01T10:15:05.000Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/EdwardJDavey/status/2094730758883570171",
          "textSnippet": "But electoral reform is just one thread of what a Liberal vision means for this country. It is part of a wider change that gives power to the powerless and holds the already powerful to account."
        }
      ]
    },
